---
title: MF-02 · Candidate answers consent, application and attribution are created
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CA as Candidate
  participant FE as Web App
  participant API as SubmissionConsent endpoints
  participant H as RespondSubmissionConsent handler
  participant P as SubmissionAcceptancePolicy
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as Mf03ScoringTrigger
  CA->>FE: Open consent link, choose Accept or Decline
  FE->>API: POST /submission-consents/{token}/respond
  API->>H: Send(RespondSubmissionConsentCommand)
  H->>DB: Check token hash, expiry, job still open
  alt Decline or expired
  H->>DB: Consent DECLINED / EXPIRED, Submission CONSENT_REJECTED / CONSENT_EXPIRED
  else Accept
  H->>P: Accept(submission)
  P->>DB: Application SUBMITTED + Attribution to first valid source
  H->>AI: Enqueue scoring (AiMatchResult PENDING)
  end
